WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:02.600
How dare you call yourself a journalist,

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.940
These protestors are yelling at reporter Tim Pool.

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:07.560
I'm not going to let them bully me out of

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:08.920
reporting on what they're doing.

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:11.769
Pool is part of what some call the "new media"

00:00:11.769 --> 00:00:13.920
Reporters who work for themselves

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:16.680
and often cover things the mainstream media miss.

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:18.700
The news you’re getting comes straight from me

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.350
and straight from the source on the ground.

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:22.460
That brings them viewers.

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:24.600
More than a million people subscribe

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.220
to Poole’s online channels.

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:27.440
Fascist thuggery!

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:30.289
Here, he’s videotaping antifa protestors

00:00:30.289 --> 00:00:31.940
who try to stop him

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:34.989
Tim Pool, he's getting blocked yet again

00:00:34.989 --> 00:00:37.360
the Antifa de-escalation team,

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:38.995
they actually called it, said don't touch him.

00:00:38.995 --> 00:00:40.780
And so, they actually made sure people didn't touch me,

00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:41.600
which is good.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:43.700
Antifa has a de-escalation team?

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:45.520
Yeah, they have people who try and make sure

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:47.900
nobody, you know, no one from their side starts

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:50.379
it because the cameras are rolling

00:00:50.379 --> 00:00:53.340
You call yourself a person of the left

00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:55.019
and you worked at VICE

00:00:55.019 --> 00:00:55.640
Yeah

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:58.629
But now you're mostly criticizing the left.

00:00:58.629 --> 00:01:01.420
This really strange faction of people on

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:03.199
the left that are saying ridiculous things

00:01:03.199 --> 00:01:04.142
that make no sense.

00:01:04.142 --> 00:01:05.220
They're hurting the left

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:07.020
and they're helping Donald Trump.

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:09.700
Trump gets voters who watched those protests

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:12.340
Yup. You look at this protest in Portland,

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:14.340
a Bernie Sanders supporter showed up with

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:18.370
an American flag to protest against the fascists.

00:01:18.370 --> 00:01:19.320
And so, what an Antifa do?

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:20.940
Crack them over the head with a club

00:01:20.940 --> 00:01:22.480
and put them in the hospital with a concussion.

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:24.080
[Protest sounds]

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:26.880
[Kids chanting]

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:28.400
Pool won fans with his coverage

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:30.820
of the Covington school conflict.

00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:32.220
All of these big news outlets,

00:01:32.220 --> 00:01:33.480
even the Washington Post, CNN,

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:35.440
they immediately made the assumption

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:36.770
he must be a racist sneering

00:01:36.770 --> 00:01:38.720
at this Native American man.

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:39.400
I didn't make that assumption.

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:40.740
I just see a guy banging a drum

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:41.880
and a kid with a weird look on his face.

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:43.580
So, I looked at some other videos

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:46.000
and posted his own video explanation

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.060
The initial narrative that we heard from the activists

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:50.590
was that this kid got in this man's face.

00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:52.800
You have just seen right now,

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:54.200
it's actually the other way around.

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:55.580
No one else watched the video.

00:01:55.580 --> 00:01:56.900
How could that be?

00:01:56.900 --> 00:01:58.780
No one watched the longer video?

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:00.240
Nope. Here's what happens.

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:01.940
One left wing journalist says,

00:02:01.940 --> 00:02:03.480
look at this racist.

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:06.000
His buddy sees it and says, wow, look at this racist.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:07.800
And that's a big ol’ circular game of telephone

00:02:07.800 --> 00:02:10.470
where no one actually does any fact checking.

00:02:10.470 --> 00:02:12.960
And then-- New York Times, Washington Post, CNN

00:02:12.960 --> 00:02:15.100
all publish the same fake story

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:18.760
Pool and Reason’s Robby Soave told the true story.

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:21.240
That’s a complete, complete misreading of

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:23.240
the situation. That’s exactly backward.

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:24.800
Pool doesn’t have a college degree.

00:02:24.800 --> 00:02:26.490
Or even a high school degree.

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:28.720
I like it that you're a high school dropout.

00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:29.540
Yeah, me too.

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:31.000
[laughs]

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:33.440
Instead of going to college and taking on debt

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:36.340
Pool just started videotaping what interested him.

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:37.530
I went to Occupy Wall Street

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:39.460
[Sounds]

00:02:39.460 --> 00:02:42.213
The march has begun we’re now at 13th St.

00:02:42.213 --> 00:02:43.640
and Broadway for those of you just tuning in

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:47.730
The whole damn system is guilty as hell

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:50.360
He covered riots in Ferguson, Missouri

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:53.820
[Gun shots]

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:55.660
That’s the first time I’ve been fired at

00:02:55.660 --> 00:02:56.960
You’re an action junkie.

00:02:56.960 --> 00:02:59.820
It's not so much the action but kind of,

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:01.220
you know, I’m definitely an adrenaline junkie.

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:02.240
I've been skateboarding my whole life,

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:03.060
but it was more so --

00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:04.760
I want to know why things are happening.

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:05.880
Some people don't trust the media.

00:03:05.880 --> 00:03:07.300
I don't know who to believe.

00:03:07.300 --> 00:03:09.660
Why don't I just go there and I can see for myself.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:11.580
And then it turns out there's one good way to fund that.

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:13.400
Tell people what you saw.

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:15.580
He funds his videos with advertising

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:17.830
and contributions from viewers

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:20.020
His most popular YouTube video was

00:03:20.020 --> 00:03:22.640
when he went to Sweden to look at so called

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:24.000
"No Go Zones”

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:26.319
Trump had said there are areas where you can't go.

00:03:26.319 --> 00:03:28.209
"No Go Zones"

00:03:28.209 --> 00:03:29.400
Your video said what?

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:31.310
That it was nuanced.

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:33.240
You got lots of views with nuance?

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:34.000
Yeah.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:34.740
[laughs]

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:36.300
Pool interviewed lots of people

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:38.489
And they were looting the stores here

00:03:38.489 --> 00:03:40.260
and won viewers by concluding:

00:03:40.260 --> 00:03:42.380
They certainly have their problems.

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:44.140
But you know, one side will have you believe it’s

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:45.120
the end of the world and other will have you

00:03:45.130 --> 00:03:46.280
believe nothing's happening at all.

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:49.480
Pool is now a zealot for free speech

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:50.520
When I was growing up,

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:51.920
it was the religious conservatives

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:54.100
that had the moral panic about music and swear words.

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:57.310
But today the moral panic is coming from "the left."

00:03:57.310 --> 00:03:58.580
What happened to the left at Berkeley

00:03:58.580 --> 00:03:59.960
holding up signs saying "free speech today"

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:01.520
the left shows up with torches

00:04:01.520 --> 00:04:02.820
and burns free speech signs.

00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:04.040
That's not the left.

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:05.100
And so, you know,

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:06.060
It is the left!

00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:06.600
But

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:07.240
It’s not the old left.

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:09.620
They want everyone to believe that someone

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:11.780
like me who was a supporter of Bernie Sanders

00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:14.980
is a conservative that way actual conservatives

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:16.280
look insane.

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:18.700
Pool is one of many new media people who are

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:21.139
changing how reporting is done.

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:23.350
Independent, uncensored

00:04:23.350 --> 00:04:25.360
I don’t agree with everything they say,

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:27.620
but I’m sure glad they’re out there.

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:29.040
They give us more choice.

